[{"title":"舟溯湘江杂咏","author":"蒋冕","text":"客舟清晚溯湘川，满目山光雁影边。\n碧草寒波双鹭浴，白蘋芳渚一鸥眠。\n矶头石古迷荒藓，浦口帆归带暝烟。\n明日衡阳江上路，新诗题满彩云笺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26809,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一苇斋二首 其一","author":"蒋冕","text":"此身天地一虚舟，去住无心着处浮。\n欧舫轩窗聊寄傲，米家书画且藏收。\n半檐竹雪沧洲趣，四壁松涛岛屿秋。\n有力谁能移夜半，人间汗漫许同游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26810,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一苇斋二首 其二","author":"蒋冕","text":"此生飘泊等萍浮，一室还成不系舟。\n风雨漫教萝作缆，烟波无际月垂钩。\n篷窗夜静渔讴杳，芦被春深鹤梦幽。\n安得因风致双鲤，问渠终忘济川不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26811,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送无极县教谕甘秉节赴任","author":"蒋冕","text":"家住苍梧宦入燕，迢迢亲舍岭云边。\n道行绛帐青毡外，梦绕斑衣白发前。\n远道双鱼春水隔，寒窗微蠹夜灯悬。\n不知坛杏花閒月，几许清吟付彩笺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26812,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"衡府范伴读赴任","author":"蒋冕","text":"莫道江都老仲舒，清时聊尔曳长裾。\n汉庭独羡东平乐，鲁国仍传伏胜书。\n千里梦应归白下，几篇诗欲过黄初。\n新城桃李知多少，门外时时问起居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26813,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次侍读白先生郊斋诗韵","author":"蒋冕","text":"南郊和气破春寒，誓听彤庭晓漏残。\n百辟在公三日戒，六符呈瑞万人看。\n杓衡彻夜辉黄幄，牲璧中宵奠紫坛。\n豫想燔柴严对越，遥空香雾散椒兰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26814,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送克温尊甫先生","author":"蒋冕","text":"朝扣天阍暮即还，冥鸿深入乱云间。\n解缨待濯沧浪水，蹑履先寻阳羡山。\n世事无关何足累，人生有子始能閒。\n道旁莫羡金章贵，莱綵犹堪奉寿颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26815,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游虎丘","author":"蒋冕","text":"豪华自古说苏州，近郭嵓峦此最幽。\n何事玉凫仍故物，当时金虎但荒丘。\n千人石在听经杳，双剑池空草色秋。\n倚遍危栏更回首，晚鸦无数夕枝头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26816,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张祐司训较艺还当涂","author":"蒋冕","text":"经谈孔壁士如林，翘首龙门冀赏音。\n檐内命题秋院静，灯前批卷夜堂深。\n赋惊五色宁迷眼，笔想三长独苦心。\n淡墨榜开舆论惬，高名从此重南金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26817,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初叨赐鲥鱼志感","author":"蒋冕","text":"东南嘉味说江鲥，当暑分鲜下赤墀。\n贡入争传喧漕路，篚开犹自带冰澌。\n古人多骨空留恨，今日新恩合赋诗。\n一饭可能忘厚报，深惭犬马力先疲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26818,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听琴再叠前韵","author":"蒋冕","text":"一听西川拥鼻吟，悠然古意未销沈。\n空山落木三秋景，老鹤孤鸿万里心。\n庄叟漫誇渔父圣，伏波终怯武陵深。\n越裳杳杳徛兰远，空谷能无感足音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26819,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪祀陵园毕夜归昌平小憩简悔轩少宗伯","author":"蒋冕","text":"寝园春祀礼初成，乘月归来信马行。\n乱石寒流才数里，荒城残漏已三更。\n片时僧舍还乡梦，满路山禽唤客声。\n风景有谁能品藻，谪仙诗句玉壶清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26820,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次熊峰先生韵题宁庵先生予庄","author":"蒋冕","text":"垄上呼童剪草莱，行行无数好山来。\n夕阳牛背频闻笛，春水鸥边忽见梅。\n蔬圃不缘农事废，柴门长为野人开。\n淡中滋味真难数，咬得菘心与芥台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26821,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次宫保戒轩靳公诗韵寄寿少博守溪王公","author":"蒋冕","text":"襟度渊然隘九州，济川功就等虚舟。\n名从晋国三槐著，身共睢阳五老游。\n绿野林峦千古意，平泉松竹四时秋。\n不知图像凌烟者，出处输公几百筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26822,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕上","author":"蒋冕","text":"梦里鸡声到枕边，披衣起坐兴茫然。\n流年未老长多病，处世无能秪自怜。\n旅况几宵燕市酒，归心千里楚江船。\n黄扉三载成何事，孤负日高花影眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26823,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘怀","author":"蒋冕","text":"欲向江头买钓蓑，短篷轻楫溯烟波。\n末赓楚泽骚人赋，且听沧浪孺子歌。\n杜若雨晴秋色老，芙蓉霜冷月明多。\n湘灵倘肯怜乡曲，应傍西风鼓瑟过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26824,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清源舟中漫书","author":"蒋冕","text":"寒鸦日日晚投林，我独怀归未遂心。\n身寄卫河舟上榻，梦萦湘水岸边岑。\n年华荏苒双蓬鬓，病体支离一布衾。\n却喜故人知我意，夜窗联话到更深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26825,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈用脩之辰州府通判","author":"蒋冕","text":"暮年亲友最关情，一举离觞百感生。\n池草几番康乐梦，云山何处酉阳城。\n江湖去鹢三秋景，霄汉飞鹏万里程。\n西望桂林才咫尺，春风莱綵好相迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26826,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再次韵送用脩","author":"蒋冕","text":"清朝父子羡韦平，宠眷同时荷圣情。\n奉币汉祠方摄祭，扬鞭蜀道岂难行。\n瑞占象纬星随节，诗纪关山日有程。\n回首五云频极目，每因于役念苍生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26827,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大司马幸庵彭公弟济永省兄西还次韵","author":"蒋冕","text":"京华席煖便还乡，不论岍歧道路长。\n郊薮凤麟宁易得，朝家罗网正高张。\n池瑭在处频生梦，风雨今宵且对床。\n闻道年来富吟咏，几多诗卷墨花香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26828,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京城见梅","author":"蒋冕","text":"冰雪丛中早立身，清标原不染纤尘。\n宜寒宜煖虽因地，开早开迟总是春。\n庾岭清香飘月下，孤山疏影照湖滨。\n并将此日东风面，欲倩丹青为写真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26829,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送同知儋州事陈君汝坚进苏州府通判致仕归应城","author":"蒋冕","text":"尘世劳劳宦海间，几人垂老即投閒。\n新衔初换苏州倅，好梦先归楚泽山。\n海上棠阴留治所，庭前荆树重乡关。\n冥鸿天外谁能慕，不似空林倦鸟还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26830,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"砺庵少保初度日酒阑石斋少保咏水晶葡萄为寿湖东少保有诗次韵冕亦继作","author":"蒋冕","text":"水晶珠在玉盘堆，还忆春风手自栽。\n味比蓬山仙醴胜，根随汉使节旄回。\n延年何必求灵药，酿酒偏宜注寿杯。\n岁岁华筵酣醉后，蔗浆茶饮可能陪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26831,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谈往事","author":"蒋冕","text":"唾壶声里出商讴，身在元龙百尺楼。\n莫对青山谈往事，且容华发系閒愁。\n酒杯到手时能醉，尘务撩人梦不休。\n鸥鹭有盟非一日，烟波随处着扁舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26832,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病半月小愈偶书","author":"蒋冕","text":"笔床茶灶具轻舟，拟向湘江昼夜浮。\n大块何心令我病，高人从古与天游。\n梦思海上蓬莱岛，兴在湖南杜若州。\n三十八年尘土里，风霜空敝黑貂裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26833,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣怀","author":"蒋冕","text":"不分竹下与松间，牧叟樵夫任往还。\n忧国泪边空白鬓，登楼眼里有青山。\n诗成伏枕聊乘兴，酒对看花暂解颜。\n世事百年徒役役，那知物外有人閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26834,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨起二首 其一","author":"蒋冕","text":"晨起科头坐小斋，纷然寒雀噪空阶。\n疏疏蒲柳霜先瘁，短短松篁雪半堆。\n信口讴吟聊趁韵，见人觞奕也开怀。\n衰年自觉精神减，何幸君王许赐骸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26835,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨起二首 其二","author":"蒋冕","text":"残腊无多岁欲更，寒云漠漠拥柴荆。\n百年能得几时好，两月全无旬日晴。\n身似风前蓬半朽，眼如花外雾丛生。\n远游姑待春前后，且办烟蓑近郭行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26836,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自七里桥北至砻岩途间漫兴","author":"蒋冕","text":"危桥北度日平西，恣意寻幽信马蹄。\n苍雾林边山近远，青松石上路高低。\n草铺长?烟穔板，秧出新针水满畦。\n多谢有情双野鸟，飞来飞去向人啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26837,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"砻岩去吾郡城虽不远顾平生未始一游自去年冬仲至今年春季未半岁间乃获两至其地登览之馀喜而得诗","author":"蒋冕","text":"厓当窈曲更通明，似敞高轩数百楹。\n玉黍扫空俄复积，石田抛久可曾耕。\n蜿蜒神物何年化，黯惨寒云尽日横。\n老去自怜无记性，两回来往路还生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26838,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵游湘山二首 其一","author":"蒋冕","text":"寺背城闉客到稀，白云终日锁禅扉。\n几人冒雪寻僧话，何处凌空有锡飞。\n西域路遥惟葬履，南华岁久不传衣。\n三生石上谁同坐，说着无生忘却归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26839,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵游湘山二首 其二","author":"蒋冕","text":"来游我尚记孩提，塔顶分明鹳雀栖。\n法自黄梅传岭外，人从郴水住湘西。\n九天月照千江白，一树花开五叶齐。\n多少古碑遭劫火，姓名何用壁间题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26840,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次祝大参别韵","author":"蒋冕","text":"穷乡一日几阴晴，岚气何妨暂湿缨。\n迎客好山如揖让，向人幽鸟自和鸣。\n梦悬魏阙无时忘，心似湘江彻底清。\n垂老相逢俄又别，祖筵瞻望不胜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26841,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春郊杂兴","author":"蒋冕","text":"自谙麋鹿性，甘隐水云乡。\n陶令五株柳，葛公千树桑。\n雨悭催灌药，风煖看移秧。\n耕罢蓑方矖，刍来酒试尝。\n沙晴鸥卧稳，泥滑燕飞忙。\n社散人归晚，前村已夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26842,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"蒋冕","text":"群动息已久，萧然忘世纷。\n半窗秋色老，几度瑞烟芬。\n琴弄羁人操，书翻古篆文。\n旅怀燕市月，乡梦楚江云。\n衣薄惊寒早，灯残夜过分。\n一声南去雁，此际最先闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26843,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊行","author":"蒋冕","text":"郊行逢故旧，邀我到柴关。\n缓踏溪边路，同登雨后山。\n竹泉烟冉冉，稻垄水潺潺。\n沙鹭飞仍下，园蜂去复还。\n草间黄犊健，天际白云閒。\n林壑谁高卧，清风不可攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26844,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长门怨","author":"蒋冕","text":"棱棱霜满天，皎皎白如练。\n才闻歌吹声，又过昭阳殿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26845,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江曲","author":"蒋冕","text":"春江风浪生，细雨多芳草。\n梦随归雁飞，片时千里道。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26846,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒲石","author":"蒋冕","text":"着石根虽浅，东风吹便青。\n卷帘新雨过，春色满阶庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26847,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖山秋晓","author":"蒋冕","text":"翠岫晓云横，湖光一镜明。\n林间有红叶，万壑总秋声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26848,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画桃桃边有竹数竿又有鸟集于桃上","author":"蒋冕","text":"东风庭院夕阳斜，静对疏篁玩物华。\n忽见夭桃笑相向，始知春色到寒家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26849,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渊明对菊图","author":"蒋冕","text":"司马江山已属刘，区区五斗肯淹留。\n莫嗔贫到瓶无粟，尚有黄花对酒瓯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26850,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画马二首 其一","author":"蒋冕","text":"千金骏骨本空群，一入天闲更绝尘。\n元狩乐歌今不作，松阴空老涯洼身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26851,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画马二首 其二","author":"蒋冕","text":"来如奔电去如风，百万驽骀一洗空。\n谁遣时清?燧熄，朝朝羁束柳阴中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26852,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村田图杂咏","author":"蒋冕","text":"茅舍新蚕作茧迟，邻家桑柘尽空枝。\n持筐欲向街头卖，更恐豪门索旧丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26853,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村田景","author":"蒋冕","text":"圈豕登盘酒满壶，高台红烛瑞烟敷。\n里巫唱罢拦门曲，新妇升堂拜舅姑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26854,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画双蝶趁朱樱花有鸟鸣于花上","author":"蒋冕","text":"红樱桃下整乌云，春色枝头有几分。\n欲写芳情寄双蝶，数声禽语隔花闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26855,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"蒋冕","text":"溪山无处不春风，远近楼台紫翠中。\n游客自来还自去，落花偏衬马蹄红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26856,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕应制二首 其一","author":"蒋冕","text":"蓬山矗矗枕仙鳌，五色云中紫极高。\n明月似能知圣意，清光偏照赭黄袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26857,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕应制二首 其二","author":"蒋冕","text":"辇路尘生香不断，灯楼月映彩初圆。\n太平时节风光好，烟火今年胜去年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26858,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村市","author":"蒋冕","text":"濛濛细雨湿荷花，宿贾来迟不饮茶。\n细袖频翻云髻乱，尊前一曲是琵琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26859,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旗亭","author":"蒋冕","text":"旗亭路绕绿杨边，酒熟长招贾客船。\n日晚登楼望江上，帆樯次第到门前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26860,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暑中偶过僧舍后土山纳凉","author":"蒋冕","text":"积土山头偶一过，薰风生处绿阴多。\n尘中忽见湘南景，欲解朝衣挂薜萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26861,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出城西送客漫题","author":"蒋冕","text":"晓出西城又向西，人家尽处有招提。\n绿阴不隔红尘路，时见行人驻马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26862,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送唐楷还灌阳","author":"蒋冕","text":"蒸衡江上忆联舟，多少风涛入壮游。\n直到新河始分手，几宵清话浣离忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26863,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游山寺","author":"蒋冕","text":"病馀长与俗多违，策杖频来扣竹扉。\n行过空林僧不见，庭前惟有白云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26864,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次邃庵先生待隐园诗韵","author":"蒋冕","text":"古槐阴下坐移时，天外凉生一叶知。\n谁遣林塘有丝竹，残蝉刚抱最高枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26865,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋夜漫吟","author":"蒋冕","text":"去年精力减前年，情到今年倍飒然。\n人世能为几时客，篝灯犹自理遗编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26866,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋夜枕上漫吟","author":"蒋冕","text":"寒恋衾裯梦未成，呼童推户看阴晴。\n一庭风露清如洗，月过松梢夜四更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26867,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送太学生陈尊卿还湘中二首 其一","author":"蒋冕","text":"湘罗碧绕二妃祠，双冢峨峨傍水湄。\n姻旧平生情不浅，何时为草丽牲碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26868,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送太学生陈尊卿还湘中二首 其二","author":"蒋冕","text":"庭外秋风一夜生，因君归去不胜情。\n故园松菊犹存否，鸿雁来时好寄声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26869,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"蒋冕","text":"玉堂天上近台垣，未报涓埃愧圣恩。\n待许衣冠挂神武，湘南归老水云村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26870,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过安山怀司空宋公","author":"蒋冕","text":"河自安山一派通，百年疏浚宋司空。\n当时蓑笠寻源处，犹在村翁指顾中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26871,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶感","author":"蒋冕","text":"万里关山路渺茫，年年佳节在他乡。\n催成两鬓如霜雪，半是晨风半夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26872,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹石","author":"蒋冕","text":"宁须种种谱宣和，一片春云亦自多。\n谁遣此君相伴住，翻枝常入楚人歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26873,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫吟","author":"蒋冕","text":"梦醒书斋月欲斜，瞢腾病眼半昏花。\n长安第一楼头客，独向西风苦忆家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26874,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芦雁","author":"蒋冕","text":"紫塞先秋已有霜，暂来栖息水云乡。\n北归只待春前后，可是区区恋稻梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26875,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晴对酒简王閒斋","author":"陈琛","text":"平生负战艺，自拟无遗镞。\n不侯由数奇，利颖徒为秃。\n采芳入儒林，岁晚逞幽独。\n峨冠谈唐虞，发我十年读。\n春风与时雨，英俊任薰沐。\n逍遥吏隐兼，清宁天与福。\n何日访子真，惠阳见郑谷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26876,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樗庭为同年丁敬夫先翁赋","author":"陈琛","text":"江水西来深复深，老翁江上看浮沈。\n也知渴饮止满腹，时取津津浇杏林。\n人将杏花比仙岛，花实长春雨露好。\n翁言吾庭更有樗，百年欲与吾俱老。\n万丈丝纶收钓竿，倚樗长啸摇金山。\n庭中步影苍苔滑，感慨人间行路难。\n路难祇应樗下息，忽见新槐长百尺。\n车盖亭亭荫道旁，树木真为人爱惜。\n世人疑天感应迂，钻核能留杏一株。\n槐阴写入樗庭卷，始信阴功果有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26877,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]